  "comments": "<p>Two main groups of style are known.<br><br><i>Obverse</i><br>Die <strong>1</strong> - legend in flat font.<br>Die <strong>2</strong> - date in flat font, DANMARK outlined.<br><br><i>Reverse</i><br>Die <strong>A</strong> - ØRE in denomination in flat font.<br>Die <strong>B</strong> - ØRE in denomination outlined.<br><br><i>Combinations</i><br><strong>1</strong>+<strong>A</strong>: 1990-1995, 1999-2008.</p><p>Picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/66fd877948e9f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/66fd877948e9f.jpg\"></a><br><strong>2</strong>+<strong>B</strong>: 1996-1998.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61616667dc8c7.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61616667dc8c7.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br>Initials on the 1990 coins.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/560aa9bf6a0af.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/560aa9bf6a0af.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/659de8f1cc87f.png\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/659de8f1cc87f.png\"></a>JD239<br>Ole</p>",
